y well  across the board for everybody involved  so  it was really kind of clever when you  think about it so wow this video is way  too long there's a lot more to say but  let's do that in the comments let me  know what you thought about the finale  you thought about ed living in the gray  making that decision  everyone else how they played a part and  let me know what questions you have  going into season three because like i  said i will follow up with that video  next  so that we can talk about where we think  things are going please like this video  if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already thanks for watching i'll  talk to you soon
 

